    "created_at": "2017-03-15T20:44:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-16T21:41:02Z",
    "body": "Here are all the tests relevant to the event handler processing algorithm:\r\n\r\n- http://w3c-test.org/html/webappapis/scripting/events/event-handler-processing-algorithm.html\r\n- http://w3c-test.org/html/webappapis/scripting/events/event-handler-processing-algorithm-manual.html\r\n- http://w3c-test.org/html/webappapis/scripting/events/event-handler-processing-algorithm-error/ directory\r\n- http://w3c-test.org/html/browsers/browsing-the-web/unloading-documents/beforeunload-canceling.html\r\n\r\nImplementation status:\r\n\r\n- Firefox nightly confirmed passes everything after https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1345996\r\n- Chrome:\r\n  - Does not do error correctly: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=685276\r\n  - Does not do beforeunload correctly: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=692203\r\n- Edge:\r\n  - Does not pass 5th arg to onerror: https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/platform/issues/7203307/\r\n  - Does not treat synthetic ErrorEvents correctly: https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/platform/issues/11286304/\r\n  - Does not do beforeunload correctly: https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/platform/issues/11286419/\r\n- Safari: tiiiny bug https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=169789",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
